              "content": "=<instructions>\nHelp me to write a short intro using the story below, and include (integrate) the intro that was written by me. \n\nRequirements\n- Make sure to keep the 8th grade reading level.\n- Integrate the intro I've written, not as it is, but make it part of the intro\n- Start with something like \"tonight, we'll be talking about ...\" and then the summary of the topic\n- End the intro with something like \"Let's start the journey\" or similar\n</instructions>\n\n<story>\n{{ $json.story }}\n</story>\n\n<intro>\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json.Intro }}\n</intro>"
            }
          ]
        },
